cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this release when you use the package. When you use
  VegVault data, cite the version you used, the VegVault data paper
  (https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-025-06176-1) and the original data
  sources, which get_references() lists for your selection.
type: software
title: "vaultkeepr: an R package to access the VegVault database"
